{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1000_009rit", "source_sha256": "b4bc6b32c22463800807c96129f3987c0c6f927771bad019edc95c763f1f4453", "ja": "いえ、それが……何ていうか、\nとにかく捕まらないんですよ、あの人がっ！", "zh": "不是的，那个……该怎么说呢，\n总之就是抓不到那个人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "a112033eee76688606c5b8f88244b3bb736aa22548c2820e138a2218541c6790", "ja": "あの人って、{$P$}くん？\nそういえば最近、やけに忙しそうよね。", "zh": "你说的“那个人”，是指{$P$}？\n说起来，他最近确实显得格外忙碌呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1002_009rit", "source_sha256": "309a8b6b3eae3c65c5afebe7fbd490bca79b204ba876c1c21a81e0565971e66e", "ja": "そうなんですよ！　ツアーもあるし、忙しいのは\n仕方ないんですけど。なんか丸投げっていうか……。", "zh": "就是这样！又要巡演，忙也是没办法的事。不过总觉得像是把事情全丢给我了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1003_009rit", "source_sha256": "7cb1e6a0d1823e4c41a26216951f8629a1787b88b315612ce3b959712b2f1e17", "ja": "そりゃあ、「自分の企画で劇場公演がしたい」\nって言ったのは私ですけど。", "zh": "那确实是我说过“想用自己的企划举办剧场公演”的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1004_009rit", "source_sha256": "2fd590073806a1c4fd68f9bbdb0392dc09f4c093db24932eebf2d4c0e05b3954", "ja": "だから、自分のソロ曲お披露目公演で任せてもらえて、\nうれしいですよ？　けど、限度ってものが……。", "zh": "所以，能把自己的独唱曲首次公演交给我负责，我当然很高兴啊？可是，也该有个限度吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "7996fd0b4f53a499c4f49b1082d6ad67b05356062f5b36c8c06ee4981aae0b99", "ja": "つまり、放っておかれてる気がするのね！？\nわかるわ～、構ってもらわないと寂しいもの！", "zh": "也就是说，你觉得自己被晾在一边了吧！？\n我懂～没人陪着自己就会感到寂寞嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1006_009rit", "source_sha256": "89ca929c75a3e838da71d01a7676a9f6ad521d1eff63c0eb31084b70480a4318", "ja": "いえ、そういうことじゃないんですけど……ほら、\n企画承認のハンコが必要な書類とか、あるでしょう？", "zh": "不，不是那个意思……你看，像是需要盖企划审批章的文件，不是有这种东西吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "4be989191e9a928dc50f3841f954b4cf72a323243c929a2772a9b7a50598cbfb", "ja": "そこも重要よね！　特に経理なんて、\nハンコがないと仕事が進められないもの！", "zh": "那部分也很重要呢！尤其是财务，没有印章的话，工作就进行不下去了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1008_042miy", "source_sha256": "d554917c422cdecb320feab72f916958d118eb2f258447be4b1fdfe1f68de255", "ja": "なるほど～。ハンコがないと、私たちの行き先も\n定まらないんですね～。それは困りましたな～。", "zh": "原来如此～没有印章的话，连我们的去向都无法确定呢～那可就麻烦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1009_se", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1010_008tak", "source_sha256": "cc8e6d69907a794cd6c88924b95723081cde064171a2bf71464c0f856b7e7780", "ja": "お疲れさまです。おや……\n{$P$}は、まだのようですね。", "zh": "辛苦了。哎呀……\n看来给{$P$}的包裹还没到呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "990ed11d5621237dbc01a121220314a76ea411f07c9fe416102920398078af7c", "ja": "ねえねえ、律子あてに荷物が届いてるぞ。\n本って書いてあるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "喂喂，有寄给律子的包裹哦。\n上面好像写着是书……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1012_009rit", "source_sha256": "8daa98df796daaa34a5bc2d1e58329147fe17cd90ac0fa09bac620e5a5df26c6", "ja": "あら、ありがとう！　たしかに、私が注文してた本ね。\n忙しすぎて忘れちゃってたわ。", "zh": "哎呀，谢谢！确实是我订的书呢。\n太忙了，我都给忘了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1013_042miy", "source_sha256": "c1c7218184c1123d759df7d90fbc369c91511e28b538ec833e42f3b381759863", "ja": "律子さん、何の本を買ったんですか～？", "zh": "律子小姐，你买了什么书呀～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1014_009rit", "source_sha256": "a7c74204a497d00e86ee88d81a0f8e5cba1762af3fad58be28112f73368d3ab6", "ja": "それはえっと、その……ただの小説よ。\n恋愛もの……みたいな。", "zh": "那是……呃，那个……只是普通的小说。\n好像是恋爱题材的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1015_008tak", "source_sha256": "ff76ff08cad94b63789ea2ccae49e266f877b8ba6e0e73ab906182e9276e3110", "ja": "律子嬢は読書家ですね。\nしかし、恋愛ものとは……興味深いです。", "zh": "律子小姐真爱看书呢。\n不过，居然是恋爱小说……真是有趣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "1b1fd9fbb1d535630d4ae9fe4f4b09d911317fe784be547eb2e93575c77e2712", "ja": "律子ちゃん、恋愛に興味があるの？\nもしかして……今、好きな人がいたり！？", "zh": "律子，你对谈恋爱感兴趣吗？\n难道说……现在有喜欢的人了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1017_009rit", "source_sha256": "a05331c0966b5a4ada634ed429324374f9a4004c4c6e6358f3da1608e9e81e3d", "ja": "もうっ、からかわないでくださいよ、莉緒さん！\nそんなんじゃないですから！", "zh": "真是的，别拿我开玩笑了，莉绪姐！\n才不是那么回事呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1018_009rit", "source_sha256": "4e8db2223e8d4dd94238b2c173d394f93e8e23cc9fb7f42734097e2247a06074", "ja": "ほら、アイドルは恋愛の曲も歌うでしょ？\nだから参考に……。", "zh": "你看，偶像也会唱恋爱歌曲吧？\n所以想参考一下……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1019_013hib", "source_sha256": "6be39362cc6a1036af8e97713bd020b19ce4ce6f57baaf79e664613672cfef20", "ja": "ふーん、そうなんだ～。", "zh": "哦——原来是这样啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "e0ccf460d71be6f4e8bfb93e57415b6537d1be00d47978ab63bb73835146b57f", "ja": "なるほど、参考にですね～。", "zh": "原来如此，是拿来参考的呀～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1021_009rit", "source_sha256": "aec6defcb89ba4146660ca3878c96181d5b8ffcdc87a17e17f8e54b73439b2b0", "ja": "な、何でニヤニヤしてるのよ、みんな……。\nああもう！　本当に違うんだからっ！", "zh": "为、为什么大家都在偷笑啊……。\n真是的！真的不是你们想的那样啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1022_p", "source_sha256": "a052c23e915f6ac730c90bab0389a93ebefea01f775a06aef8d915c954806e57", "ja": "（定期公演の打ち合わせなのに、すっかり遅くなって\nしまった。しかも、次の打ち合わせが迫っている！）", "zh": "（明明是在商量定期公演的事情，却不知不觉聊到了很晚。而且，下一场会议也马上要开始了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1023_se", "source_sha256": "d335a178fbd7ae98d0648ab5d06d8fc395d9d5ed273ce75af53cfc4a761f95b7", "ja": "バタバタバタ……ガチャ！", "zh": "啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……咔嗒！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b90ce8de7163e0d9d4cfd23c76a807d6db81664c30b9318ac4d7cc7b2676bdc2", "ja": "みんな、遅くなってすまない！", "zh": "大家，我来晚了，不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "e19dd258ea94488f6ee603412fc7a76da6f3d3c8233d7b37f5c1856dd6903b7a", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさま。", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1026_p", "source_sha256": "4ca9717ba03953a9c46793eaed090eef88cb92b7f2f6ea13f5a88227bb10fe3f", "ja": "来たばっかりなんだけど、実はこの後、他の\n打ち合わせがあって。すぐ出なくちゃなんだ……。", "zh": "我才刚到，不过其实待会儿还有别的会议。得马上走了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1027_009rit", "source_sha256": "7564615dda56d84f365fb53fd100a8432f6a011ba5aff00bd419cc2e3e0a7a55", "ja": "ええっ、またですか！？", "zh": "诶，又要走吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1028_009rit", "source_sha256": "479782d928481ed43f01cf1347daaecbd616968c73733cbbdb83e4213cdf14ba", "ja": "もう、忙しいのは結構ですけど。私が出した書類、\nちゃんと目を通してくれてますか？", "zh": "真是的，忙一点倒也没什么。你有认真看过我交上去的文件吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1029_p", "source_sha256": "c60ba82794f9ac1dfd1146731c43073f4dbefe7769648d07b5962b49d20d681a", "ja": "ううっ、それは……。", "zh": "呜，那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1030_009rit", "source_sha256": "192ad59f679b75b16e479ea37914740653cdab4eac6377fb739cbae15cd3d6ba", "ja": "やっぱり……もう、本当にお願いしますよ？\nそうでなくても、進行ギリギリなんですから。", "zh": "果然……真是的，真的拜托你了，好吗？  \n就算不这样，进度也已经赶得紧紧巴巴了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1031_p", "source_sha256": "b09230cfe859d43c585d17be648caaf474340c099069d870e3c1a62d574c6fb1", "ja": "ごめん、今日帰ったら確認するよ。\n……それで、準備の方は……。", "zh": "抱歉，今天回去后我会确认的。\n……那么，准备工作这边……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1032_009rit", "source_sha256": "1ec0af45ae836c77d0177b550a23dc177b7cf37a319e59bf09b93063e10b7c06", "ja": "もちろん、できる限りのことはしてます。まだ\n決まってないこともありますけど、やれる範囲内で。", "zh": "当然，我已经在尽可能地做了。虽然还有些事情没定下来，但我会在力所能及的范围内努力。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1033_p", "source_sha256": "19a16609bf549d3b4c3e40764a82df0fc313533a9e3daea9bafe96c530d0b930", "ja": "ありがとう！　律子はやっぱり、頼りになるな。\nあとは、ええと……ああっ、すまない！　もう時間だ！", "zh": "谢谢你！律子果然靠得住啊。\n还有就是，呃……啊，抱歉！已经到时间了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1034_009rit", "source_sha256": "8b7ed425578a2660ae600cf23acb493b95002e5b338f7fece89c7eba25cc0b3c", "ja": "えっ、{$P$}！？", "zh": "咦，{$P$}！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1035_p", "source_sha256": "4e78bf1cd546123ef6b89c8fb1d7849bac29cb94ad9fa641439cc4fc33ef25c5", "ja": "律子、また連絡する！", "zh": "律子，我回头再联系你！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1036_se", "source_sha256": "26c542cc506cdc5b8c0d8634cfaa98ec1472de9e5308d0076f177ee279ec1016", "ja": "ガチャ、バタバタバタ……", "zh": "咔嗒、啪嗒啪嗒啪嗒……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1037_009rit", "source_sha256": "f48d5865981103aa04745f01eb2276f5f15bf9caf9c2b4b6183e4c2aadfc5b89", "ja": "い、行っちゃった……。\n他にも相談したいことがあったのに……。", "zh": "走、走了啊……。\n明明还有别的事想商量呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1038_013hib", "source_sha256": "c0006feafe1383cf14d5c7dd012bb29ee6288e46bc825e34ad406be5c18ddd3e", "ja": "あんなに慌ててる{$P$}、\n初めて見たぞ。本当に忙しいんだな……。", "zh": "看到{$P$}那么慌慌张张的样子，我还是第一次见到。看来真的很忙啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1039_009rit", "source_sha256": "9d0d14319574e24644c2e43639786ff4ca3b7aa570c060ea1df2ad69684f3ef7", "ja": "それはわかってるけど……\nでも、もうちょっと話を聞いてくれたって……。", "zh": "这我知道，可是……至少也该再听我说几句吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1040_046rio", "source_sha256": "4e7d27d2de0975a9af6f806976823531a38e63022c12bd5afe396a6017c8055a", "ja": "そうよね。いくら任されてるといっても、\nあんまり放置されると不安よね。", "zh": "是啊。就算说是交给她负责的，\n一直被这样放着不管，也会让人不安吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1041_046rio", "source_sha256": "efa6a6b4871d6cda6de25fcc2956ff9554d233606443dff6c12c5dbc98672ea2", "ja": "もちろん、律子ちゃんを信頼してるってことでも\nあるんでしょうけど……。", "zh": "当然，这应该也说明他是很信任律子你的就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1043_008tak", "source_sha256": "b05151fc1bfd02975ae139d284622174c277be35bc06d3bcc4e52dbef432edaf", "ja": "律子嬢。何か気がかりな事があれば、抱え込まず……\nどうか私達にもお話しください。", "zh": "律子小姐，如果有什么在意的事情，还请不要独自烦恼……请务必也告诉我们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1044_008tak", "source_sha256": "26a2be13ca8df23ca28b299be9fc327bb3e3b643eef4a23472a16e9c40618f00", "ja": "企画は律子嬢ですが、劇場公演は皆で作るもの。\n協力して、事を進めて参りましょう。", "zh": "企划虽是律子小姐负责，但剧场公演是大家共同打造的。让我们互相配合，把事情推进下去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1045_009rit", "source_sha256": "c2711689201f0fdcf6fdbce11462ef704f73a13cea24b20188867cbd84f38b04", "ja": "助かるわ、貴音。……そうね。\n今できることを、やるしかないわよね。", "zh": "帮大忙了，贵音。……是啊。\n现在能做的，也只能尽力去做了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1046_009rit", "source_sha256": "fdede758e5560dbb44f3b332cbba8701edfc57d5c13c4d90f77c2646e6ba0bfb", "ja": "ただ、私の新曲のお披露目もあるし。\n何も不安がないわけじゃないから……。", "zh": "不过，我还要首次公开我的新歌。\n也不是完全没有不安……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1047_009rit", "source_sha256": "537c5ce0c1789fd3a659c3af567c6241d5d8ab256d2503778535c02179c98799", "ja": "もう！　ホント、{$P$}ったら、\n私のこと、なんだと思ってるのかしら？", "zh": "真是的！{$P$}也真是的，到底把我当成什么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1048_042miy", "source_sha256": "dfa56515bed94c33e3238371d375613dc23c65497cbe5ad14e505086807c10f7", "ja": "そうですね～。気になるなら、\n直接、聞いてみてはどうでしょう～。", "zh": "是呢～如果很在意的话，要不要直接去问问看呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1049_009rit", "source_sha256": "468651907dd348da5cf6f5d47e075e7ce99fa9911c4e718fbba7061df4d5eeaa", "ja": "えっ？　直接聞くって、美也……\n{$P$}に？", "zh": "诶？直接问的话，是问美也……\n向{$P$}吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_intro_097_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_097_1050_042miy", "source_sha256": "50b30d95985577e5610ae8a96ddcb28121077aa7f8696b9999f16ca2193c60a5", "ja": "はい～。{$P$}さんなら、\nきっと、答えてくれると思います～。", "zh": "是的～要是{$P$}先生的话，我想他一定会回答的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
